    # "As the pizza is nearing an end, [sadie] let's out a victorious sigh."
    "披萨快吃完时，[sadie]得意地舒了口气。"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4437
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_f0baf592:

    # "Conversations turn into friendly chatter. Getting to know one another some more."
    "对话渐渐变成轻松的闲聊。进一步了解彼此。"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4438
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_932556ea_1:

    # "While also explaining why you're in her house to begin with..."
    "同时也解释你为什么会出现在她家里……"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4441
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_ca0251e0:

    # mc "...and that's why I'm here!"
    mc "……这就是我为什么会在这儿！"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4443
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_b73556a5:

    # sadie "Ah! Did my dad know that you work at [school_name]?"
    sadie "啊！我爸知道你在[school_name]工作吗？"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4445
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_e00b59f4:

    # mc "Hmm... No actually... I think I only told him I had a career change, but not any specifics."
    mc "嗯……其实没有……我只跟他说了换了工作，没说具体细节。"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4447
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_dd8dde83:

    # sadie "Makes sense! But I'm glad it's someone I know..."
    sadie "说得通！不过知道是我认识的人，还是让我松了口气……"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4452
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_899cf271:

    # extend " Especially with what lurks outside that door!"
    extend "尤其是那扇门外还潜伏着那些东西！"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4454
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_8d26308a:

    # mc "Yea... How... Why are you living here?"
    mc "是啊……怎么……你为什么住在这儿？"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4456
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_747d9692:

    # sadie "Well.. I don't have an option."
    sadie "嗯……我没别的选择。"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4458
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_4585b736:

    # mc "Don't want to move out?"
    mc "不想搬出去？"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4460
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_00a8a652:

    # sadie "It's 2024{cps=6}. . . {/cps}With what money?"
    sadie "都 2024 年了{cps=6}. . .{/cps}我哪来的钱？"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4462
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_5cd0810a:

    # sadie "I also can't leave my dad right now... He'd be all alone. He's going through a lot."
    sadie "我现在也不能丢下我爸……他会孤零零一个人。他已经够难了。"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4464
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_7c565c65:

    # sadie "It's obvious, can't you tell?"
    sadie "这很明显吧，你说呢？"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4466
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_7ecb4e70:

    # sadie "I...I can assure you he hasn't gone to work tonight."
    sadie "我……我可以向你保证他今晚没去上班。"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4468
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_05500ff6:

    # mc "Huh?"
    mc "嗯？"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4471
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_d7664b60:

    # sadie "Yeah... I'm almost positive he's gone to the casino."
    sadie "嗯……我几乎可以肯定他去了赌场。"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4473
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_4496d0a7:

    # sadie "But it's not like that... I don't think. Ultimately I don't really know what's going through his mind..."
    sadie "但应该不是……我不这么觉得。归根结底，我也不知道他在想什么……"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4475
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_579231c3:

    # sadie "He's been fairly...distant since Mom went into hospital..."
    sadie "自从妈妈住院以后，他就……相当疏远……"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4476
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_abfe8a04:

    # sadie "She was fine...and then boom. Cancer. Shit sucks."
    sadie "她本来好好的……然后砰的一下。癌症。真他妈倒霉。"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4478
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_d4dee8d4:

    # sadie "Now lots of people come in and out of here... Scary looking people..."
    sadie "现在这里进进出出很多人……看起来都很吓人……"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4479
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_28d84565:

    # mcT "Is that why his bedroom door is just gone?"
    mcT "所以他卧室的门就不见了？"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4481
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_71bb4d23:

    # sadie "I try... I do try not to pry, but it's hard when it happens where I live!"
    sadie "我尽量……我真的尽量不去打听，可这种事就发生在我住的地方，很难不多管！"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4483
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_b47ea467:

    # sadie "I don't know if he owes money to someone... or what... And honestly I don't really want to know... I think."
    sadie "我不知道他是不是欠了谁的钱……还是别的什么……说实话，我也不太想知道……我觉得。"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4487
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_aa70f643:

    # sadie "Arg! I don't know what to think, and it's not for me to know. I don't know what to do, [school_player_name]."
    sadie "唉！我不知道该怎么说，而且这也不是我该知道的事。我不知道该怎么办，[school_player_name]。"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4488
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_e5716a3e:

    # mcT "I...Didn't think it'd be this deep. [bill] always was happy and...well...normal to me."
    mcT "我……本来没想到会这么深。[bill]在我眼里一直是开心的……嗯……很普通的。"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4490
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_6654bd8a:

    # mcT "Perhaps he's in some deep shit."
    mcT "也许他摊上了大麻烦。"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4493
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_8854087d:

    # mcT "And as a result, it's affecting [sadie]."
    mcT "结果这事也牵扯到[sadie]了。"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4495
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_2a0acbc1:

    # mcT "Socially... Emotionally... And I'm sure academically."
    mcT "社交上……情感上……学业上，我敢肯定也一样。"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4497
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_77821a41:

    # mcT "It's not really my place, but I feel like I have a responsibility to at least try and help, in some way."
    mcT "这本来不关我的事，但我总觉得至少该想点办法，尽一份力。"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4498
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_b5fc7166:

    # mc "[sadie]."
    mc "[sadie]。"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4501
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_1ae8bc0d:

    # sadie "H-huh...yeah..?"
    sadie "诶、诶……嗯……？"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4503
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_a81fc2f8:

    # mc "It's not really my place, but if you want... I can look into what your dad is up to?"
    mc "本来不关我的事，不过你要是愿意……我可以去查查你爸在干什么？"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4504
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_cfcc62c8:

    # mc "I don't know what's happening, but I'd be curious to find out, and maybe help in some way..?"
    mc "我不知道里面有什么事，但我很好奇，也想弄个明白，也许还能帮上点忙……？"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4506
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_207e5787:

    # sadie "You...you would do that, for me?"
    sadie "你……你愿意为我这么做？"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4508
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_61a7688e:

    # mc "For you absolutely, but also for my own curiosity."
    mc "为你当然愿意，不过也满足了我自己的好奇心。"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4511
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_5f3e257c:

    # sadie "Okay-okay! I'm so in!"
    sadie "好、好！这事我绝对奉陪！"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4517
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_fca52711:

    # mc "No."
    mc "不。"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4519
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_39cbc2c5:

    # mc "This isn't how this works. I will be the one investigating. It could be dangerous."
    mc "不行，不是这么个做法。要查由我来查。可能有危险。"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4521
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_b77bba7d:

    # sadie "...I hear you.... But I've chosen to ignore you."
    sadie "……我听到了……但我选择当没听见。"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4523
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_51689981:

    # sadie "I am so involved! This is my family!"
    sadie "我早就陷进去了！这可是我的家人！"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4525
translate chinese d4_pizza_noPeak_fa200345:

    # mc "Hhhh.... Look. Come here."
    mc "呼……听着。过来。"

# game/Days/dayFour.rpy:4527
